OL,3,GNEWSANorth Edinburgh tram extension
OL,4,Acould be shelved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a new tramline linking
OL,7,Fthe north and centre of Edinburgh are
OL,8,Flikely to be shelved.
OL,10,FCity of Edinburgh Council proposed
OL,11,Frunning a new route connecting Crewe
OL,12,FToll and the city centre via either
OL,13,FRoseburn Path or Orchard Brae.
OL,15,FHowever, a report before the local
OL,16,Fauthority's transport and environment
OL,17,Fcommittee cited "public acceptability
OL,18,Fissues" over disputes about the two
OL,19,Fproposed lines.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
